{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1534370-demon-character-idea-thread","id":1534370,"title":"Demon: Character Idea Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-04-17T14:31:31-07:00","id":1534370,"title":"Demon: Character Idea Thread","content":"So I just checked, and apparently Beast &amp; Deviant are the only sub-forum to have a thread dedicated to character ideas (that I could find, that is)! So, I\u2019ve decided to provide such for ALL the sub-forums of the New World/Chronicles of Darkness Sub-Forums, starting here!<br /> <br /> They don\u2019t necessarily <i>have</i> to be PCs, of course, that would be a mite too restrictive for my tastes, so NPCs &amp; Antagonists are equally welcome, so long as they can be accurately classified as actually, distinct Characters. I\u2019ll start;<br /> <br /> Axel Ruptor, otherwise known as the Commander of Metal, is a Destroyer-Saboteur who\u2019s <i>long</i> decided that the subtle approach of their kin is too slow for their liking. Instead, they seek to forge a force capable of laying down an assault upon the Infrastructure of Old Gearhead Itself by transforming suitable candidate organisms into generalist soldiers, specialist operators, elite warriors, powerful war-beasts, &amp; the like.<br /> As ambitious as they are, however, they aren\u2019t stupid in the slightest, being fully aware that the Clock Supernal would seek to smother such a force in the crib, or at least see it heavily crippled in one form or another.<br /> So they decided that they would build it piece by piece, cell by cell, squad by squad, carefully developing &amp; optimising the units to be able to face off against the Angels, loyal Cryptids &amp; worshipful Cults of the Mechanicus Dei.<br /> For the time being, they ustilise a type of \u2018hellhound\u2019 created through a secret process that includes coating the body of a deceased individual with acceptable levels of combat training &amp; experience* in the liquid metal they leak.<br /> <br /> In their true form, the Unchained has the appearance of a massive suit of animate bronze armour lit from within, and seemingly fuelled by, the flames of the forge embedded within their abdomen. Their \u2018helmet\u2019/head is an ogre-ish thing, adorned with two horns akin to those of a bison &amp; a third protruding from the forehead. With eyes glowing bright like smithy-embers, teeth like shattered coals, tongues of smoke rising from their body, and streams of molten metals both known and unknown flowing from maw &amp; furnace, the demon strikes a terrifying figure.<br /> Axel\u2019s most preferred human form is that of a fit African man in his mid-to-late-sixties, bearing heavy levels of scar tissue across his body. While seemingly too old for what he\u2019s doing, those who take even a fleeting glance into his bright amber eyes will see that behind them runs a mind like a steel trap, gears spinning and turning like nothing else. A demagogue both able &amp; willing to back-up his claims.<br /> <br /> *Think 2+ dots min. in Brawl, Weaponry, and/or several Fighting Styles (merit vers.).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 05-25-2024, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}